    ],
    "text": "AMENDMENT OF SECTION 200",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      425.05,
      539.73,
      448.12
    ],
    "text": "SECTION 200 of Volume I of the Procedural Rules of the Public Service Commission published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 1589/30 of 20.02.2009 is amended as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      454.09,
      493.34,
      465.16
    ],
    "text": "200. The composition of an annual transfer committe of a Ministry or Department shall be as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.69,
      478.09,
      539.91,
      489.16
    ],
    "text": "(i) A deputy head of the relevant Department or Ministry or in the absence of such a post the senior most",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      490.09,
      301.33,
      501.16
    ],
    "text": "assistant head of such Ministry or Department ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      91.29,
      507.13,
      473.87,
      518.2
    ],
    "text": "(ii) A senior officer in charge of establishment matters of the relevant Ministry or Department ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      89.13,
      524.17,
      539.91,
      535.24
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A representative nominated by each trade union representing the category of officers and service falling",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      536.17,
      539.96,
      559.24
    ],
    "text": "within the purview of the annual transfer committee, provided that such trade union has a minimum membershipof 15% of the total number of officers.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      566.17,
      116.01,
      577.24
    ],
    "text": "or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      583.21,
      539.87,
      606.28
    ],
    "text": "A representative nominated by each trade union of which an officer has been released for fulltime trade unionwork.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      613.21,
      394.47,
      624.28
    ],
    "text": "By order of the Public Service Commission,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
